test/fixtures/

# Coverage
# Patterns below are ROOT-ANCHORED (leading slash) on purpose: pub applies
# gitignore semantics, and an unanchored `name/` matches directories named
# `name` at ANY depth — `benchmark/` excluded lib/src/core/benchmark/ and
# lib/src/plugins/benchmark/ from the published tarball of 6.2.0/6.2.1 while
# lib/zuraffa.dart still exported it (bug 1307, day-zero compile breakage).
/coverage/

